# Copy to .env.local.
# Where the Velastia API runs. Server-side only — the browser reaches it through
# /api/v1 on this app (forwarded in proxy.ts), so the session cookie stays first-party.
API_URL=http://localhost:4000
# Storefront URL for the "Visit Website" button.
NEXT_PUBLIC_STORE_URL=http://localhost:3000
# Online only: shared with the API (the same value on the API and the store),
# so the API sees each person's real IP address for its login throttle.
# PROXY_SECRET=
